{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":19616384,"ns":0,"title":"Abstract algebra","extract":"In mathematics, more specifically algebra, abstract algebra or modern algebra is the study of algebraic structures, which are sets with specific operations acting on their elements. Algebraic structures include groups, rings, fields, modules, vector spaces, lattices, and algebras over a field.","description":"Branch of mathematics","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}